  ["Stressor-assisted wet ELO", "15 mm/h (Ramu 2022, InGaAs + PMMA stressors); 20 mm/h reported as fastest (Tampere dissertation 2025)", "~3.75–5 h per 6-inch wafer (derived)", "laboratory"],
  ["Mechanically gap-opened ELO", "~10 mm/h typical, 30 mm/h best claimed (apparatus-dependent)", "~2.5–7.5 h per 6-inch wafer (derived)", "laboratory"],
